## Purpose

The owner explicitly rejects fading the wood behind the main logo/name and wants
a more realistic wooden panel with lit, raised lettering and a distinct drop shadow.
Preserve Courgette, the original mark, sign size/location and navigation.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve current header, source checks, public docs and context.
- [x] Generate an original continuous wood-grain texture with plank joints and knots.
- [x] Remove the center fade mask; keep grain equally present behind the name.
- [x] Add layered letter edges, cast shadows and warm steady backlighting.
- [x] Retain original logo pixels, typography, geometry and accessibility fallbacks.
- [x] Check actual center texture and lighting pixels, contrast and16width/text cases.
- [x] Refresh the current campaign's welcome desktop/mobile image and3:4variant.
- [x] Run existing full site/entrance checks and publish the narrowly scoped change.

## Acceptance criteria

- Wood remains opaque and textured across the sign, including its center.
- Raised sign lighting is visible without fuzzy letters, flashing or moving glow.
- No font/mark/layout changes, public cream integration or unrelated scene edits.
- Preserve existing local artifacts; do not overwrite the first Instagram delivery.
- No image-tool views or visual acceptance claims.

